Generate images with AI
In this exercise, you use an image generation model to generate images. 
You also use the OpenAI Python SDK to create a simple app 
to generate images based on your prompts.


Python Command : 
python -m venv labenv 
.\labenv\Scripts\Activate.ps1 
pip install -r requirements.txt

How to run it 
cd mslearn-ai-agents/Labfiles/07-agent-frameworkc 
az login 
python agent-framework.py

